        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Finance/Cash App reconcile cash collected (POD W4274 + 3PL remittance W4275 + bank deposit W4279) against each COD order&#x27;s amount-due (W4273), at order level, daily
Responsible (R): Finance / Cash App
Accountable (A): Finance Controller
