    <bpmn:process id="W_W4280" name="W4280. COD Physical Cash Security, Robbery/Loss Response &amp; Recovery" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Robbery/loss/security incident involving COD cash
Frequency: Incident-driven
Volume: Security incidents across the COD cash chain
Owner: Security (VS-23) / Payment Ops / Insurance (VS-26) / Loss Prevention
Participants: Security (VS-23), Insurance (VS-26), Legal (VS-100), Fraud (VS-125), Treasury (VS-18), Police
Source: workflow W4280 — COD Physical Cash Security, Robbery/Loss Response &amp; Recovery</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4280_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4280_Lane1" name="Driver">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4280_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4280_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4280_Lane2" name="Security">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4280_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4280_Lane3" name="Insurance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4280_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4280_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4280_Start5" name="Robbery/loss/security incident involving COD cash">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4280_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4280_Task6" name="Driver/3PL/Security execute the incident response (safety first, secure scene…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Driver/3PL/Security execute the incident response (safety first, secure scene, notify Security/Payment Ops/police), per the cash-security SOP (W4270)
Responsible (R): Driver / Security
Accountable (A): Head of Payment Ops / Security
Duration: Immediate</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4280_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4280_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4280_Task7" name="Security/Fraud investigate (root cause, custody breakdown, internal vs…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Security/Fraud investigate (root cause, custody breakdown, internal vs external), document, and log to the loss/security system (VS-23/VS-125)
Responsible (R): Security / Fraud
Accountable (A): Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk / COO
Duration: Per incident</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4280_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4280_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4280_Task8" name="Insurance/Legal file the claim (VS-26), pursue recovery (3PL contract W4268…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Insurance/Legal file the claim (VS-26), pursue recovery (3PL contract W4268, fidelity bond, police/legal VS-100), provision/write off unrecovered loss (W4269), and apply corrective action
Responsible (R): Insurance / Legal / Finance
Accountable (A): CFO / Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk
Duration: Per incident</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4280_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4280_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4280_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4280_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-657 (ensure controlled execution — COD Cash Collection, Custody &amp; Driver/3PL Reconciliation (PA-142.2).) | - CTL-657: cash-security SOP followed; custody controls (W4270); claim/recovery pursued (VS-26); loss provisioned (W4269)
Owner: Security (VS-23) / Payment Ops / Insurance (VS-26) / Loss Prevention</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
